{"id":"e972e30f8594d955cfe66b2b1852b46b40238aaa","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1245889","title":"AI 写的项目，让 AI 排查问题。但是有没有感觉沟通过程中读 AI 说的话很费劲，很难懂。。。","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"DeepSIeep","excerpt":"程序员 - @DeepSIeep -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/沟通\"><li></li> 沟通</a><a href=\"/tag/理解\"><li></li> 理解</a></P><p><span>27 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-01 15:44:01 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142853\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e38/0cf2/413420_normal.png?m=1789083210\" alt=\"413420\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 19:03:53 +08:00\">21h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的，因为这本就是你制造的问题，如果你理解起来轻松的话，就不太可能会出现这些问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142862\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c00d2c0ec08778dd6b40fd3392a366a3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yanqiyu\" data-uid=\"127736\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yanqiyu\">yanqiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 19:07:59 +08:00\">21h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在很多模型我感觉让它说英语阅读难度要低不少。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142885\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b73c/e398/160_normal.png?m=1786777290\" alt=\"dimlau\" data-uid=\"160\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dimlau\">dimlau</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 19:19:44 +08:00\">20h 57m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>Gemini 输出的内容理解起来暂时不那么费劲；我在 opencode 里使用其他模型输出的内容读起来就吃里不少。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142909\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/950278cf5f637f3f0ddc116601e93969?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nsjs\" data-uid=\"507787\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nsjs\">nsjs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 19:35:42 +08:00\">20h 41m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ai 喜欢说细节，你让他 up 下提升视角</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18142967\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ee8d/4a89/485321_normal.png?m=1722699093\" alt=\"getadoggie\" data-uid=\"485321\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/getadoggie\">getadoggie</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 20:28:37 +08:00\">19h 48m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我感觉你得告诉他你懂哪些，不懂哪些，他这样应该能针对性输出</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143149\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1ac9/be13/420212_normal.png?m=1790841197\" alt=\"edgeedge\" data-uid=\"420212\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/edgeedge\">edgeedge</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 22:38:53 +08:00\">17h 38m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>感觉 GPT 说话会容易过度抽象、也容易越说越长…</p><p>我会让它“言之有物”，把要说的内容，尽量关联到具体的目录、文件、逻辑机制、通用术语等“具体”事物上，若没有可对应具体事物但可举例说明的，也尽量举例。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143156\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d898/ed5e/533758_normal.png?m=1776147719\" alt=\"ASHYWHISPER\" data-uid=\"533758\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ASHYWHISPER\">ASHYWHISPER</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 22:48:12 +08:00\">17h 29m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>太棒了，非常需要🥹，之前深受秘密 夹具之苦</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143232\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c01a9990e9f1bcbea1b8b6e4b0ed12f6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kuhung\" data-uid=\"239959\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kuhung\">kuhung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-30 23:39:02 +08:00\">16h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>太抽象了 跟模型有关系 特别针对编程场景过度训练的这几个模型 用 Gemini3.8 来解读不错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143310\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d378980e43883f1b03cae2f3a89bc0b4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"KCL\" data-uid=\"690278\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/KCL\">KCL</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 01:15:01 +08:00\">15h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的，这是 GPT 模型的问题，Gemini 就好一百倍。<br>难道这就是理科生的代价？文科生模型的优势？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143345\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dba8/402e/137948_normal.png?m=1772302321\" alt=\"terence4444\" data-uid=\"137948\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/terence4444\">terence4444</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 03:47:58 +08:00\">12h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Claude 很喜欢造新词，在 Memory 让它记下要说人话不要造新词，如果不知道怎么用中文表达则用英文原文替代。<br>这样可以少掉 90% 莫名其妙的新词汇。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143389\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8687/1447/404080_normal.png?m=1784722393\" alt=\"labubu\" data-uid=\"404080\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/labubu\">labubu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 06:56:40 +08:00\">9h 20m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>哈基咪喜欢说人话</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143758\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4bc4/38c9/676530_normal.png?m=1785287761\" alt=\"bronyakaka\" data-uid=\"676530\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bronyakaka\">bronyakaka</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 12:02:08 +08:00\">4h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我给 agent 做了个快捷方式，一键说人话。当你觉得 ai 说的听不懂时，你就告诉他说人话，就行。因为 ai 说的细节太多，对别的 ai 来说很好理解，人类就不行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143815\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/97f58def8e61026ade9e3a2da85a5268?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hi9527\" data-uid=\"629616\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hi9527\">hi9527</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 12:47:50 +08:00\">3h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我已经让 AI 不要总是兜底了，还有啥夹具，棘轮啥的，头秃</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143859\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dd4c/eba9/457401_normal.png?m=1776012608\" alt=\"Crimson47\" data-uid=\"457401\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Crimson47\">Crimson47</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 13:19:18 +08:00\">2h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>信息量太大了, 尤其是 GPT, 有时候你问他一个问题他给你写一篇论文, 当我读完 ai 写的论文并且完全理解的时候可能已经完成原本的工作了...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18143920\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e306c3ca6db590927abd45fba4b22187?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"owt5008137\" data-uid=\"73685\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/owt5008137\">owt5008137</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 14:08:15 +08:00\">2h 9m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/aaxx2xx\">aaxx2xx</a> 我不用 qwen 的。这个是 gpt,glm,kimi,claude 的用词总结出来的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18144004\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0562f9c4fa649dbf65758459e05b4945?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"antipro\" data-uid=\"316588\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/antipro\">antipro</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-01 15:41:44 +08:00\">35 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这就是我之前发帖说过的，你发 10 个字，他给你回 1000 个字，其实很多东西，用个图例或者其他工程手段，很容易就说清楚了，非要洋洋洒洒写论文。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"AI 沟通 理解27 replies • 2026-10-01 15:44:01 +08:00 2 413420 21h 13m ago 是的，因为这本就是你制造的问题，如果你理解起来轻松的话，就不太可能会出现这些问题 4 yanqiyu 21h 9m ago 现在很多模型我感觉让它说英语阅读难度要低不少。 6 dimlau 20h 57m ago 1 Gemini 输出的内容理解起来暂时不那么费劲；我在 opencode 里使用其他模型输出的内容读起来就吃里不少。 8 nsjs 20h 41m ago via iPhone ai 喜欢说细节，你让他 up 下提升视角 9 getadoggie 19h 48m ago via iPhone 我感觉你得告诉他你懂哪些，不懂哪些，他这样应该能针对性输出 11 edgeedge 17h 38m ago via iPhone 感觉 GPT 说话会容易过度抽象、也容易越说越长…我会让它“言之有物”，把要说的内容，尽量关联到具体的目录、文件、逻辑机制、通用术语等“具体”事物上，若没有可对应具体事物但可举例说明的，也尽量举例。 12 ASHYWHISPER 17h 29m ago via iPhone 太棒了，非常需要🥹，之前深受秘密 夹具之苦 14 kuhung 16h 38m ago 太抽象了 跟模型有关系 特别针对编程场景过度训练的这几个模型 用 Gemini3.8 来解读不错 16 KCL 15h 2m ago 是的，这是 GPT 模型的问题，Gemini 就好一百倍。难道这就是理科生的代价？文科生模型的优势？ 18 terence4444 12h 29m ago Claude 很喜欢造新词，在 Memory 让它记下要说人话不要造新词，如果不知道怎么用中文表达则用英文原文替代。这样可以少掉 90% 莫名其妙的新词汇。 19 labubu 9h 20m ago via Android 哈基咪喜欢说人话 21 bronyakaka 4h 15m ago 我给 agent 做了个快捷方式，一键说人话。当你觉得 ai 说的听不懂时，你就告诉他说人话，就行。因为 ai 说的细节太多，对别的 ai 来说很好理解，人类就不行 22 hi9527 3h 29m ago 我已经让 AI 不要总是兜底了，还有啥夹具，棘轮啥的，头秃 23 Crimson47 2h 58m ago 信息量太大了, 尤其是 GPT, 有时候你问他一个问题他给你写一篇论文, 当我读完 ai 写的论文并且完全理解的时候可能已经完成原本的工作了... 25 owt5008137 2h 9m ago via Android @aaxx2xx 我不用 qwen 的。这个是 gpt,glm,kimi,claude 的用词总结出来的 26 antipro 35 mins ago 这就是我之前发帖说过的，你发 10 个字，他给你回 1000 个字，其实很多东西，用个图例或者其他工程手段，很容易就说清楚了，非要洋洋洒洒写论文。","fetched_at":"2026-10-01T08:21:17.967Z","ok":true}